  "description": "We’ve taken the Plowboy name and spread it across all three wheel sizes in the mountain singlespeed category. These bikes are simply singlespeed versions of the geared bikes we build except they come with our really cool Rocker dropouts. Of course if you want to run gears on a Plowboy there is a derailleur hanger option. We could go on and on about how great the Plowboys are but we won’t.\n\n- 2 Coat Powder Paint With Iron Phosphate Pre-Treatment\n- Complete Custom Fitting\n- Frame Delivered Fully Prepped And Ready To Assemble With Rust Inhibitor Sprayed Inside Seat Tube And On All Bare Metal Surfaces\n- Gusseted Head Tube/Downtube Junction (where applicable)\n- Internally Butted Head Tube\n- Reinforced Seat Collar Insert\n- Rider Specific Tubeset\n- Sealed Tubeset (no vent holes)\n- Sloping Top Tube Standard\n- Stainless Steel Cable Stops And Brake Line Guides\n- Stainless Steel Dropouts\n- Stamped head badge\n- Tig Welded Frame",
